            </note>
            <note corresp="#d53-f2" n="2" xml:id="d53-f2-content">
                <p>Attached were telegrams 41 and 42 to Saigon (<ref target="#d46">Documents
                        46</ref> and <ref target="#d47">47</ref>) and telegram 41 from Saigon (<ref
